l margins  The biopsy cavity is focally surrounded by white fibrous strands of tissue maximally 1cm in thickness  The remainder of the cavity is surrounded by yellow gray fat  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is rubbery  white tan  and intermixed with yellow strands of adipose tissue  No tumor is grossly identified  SECTION CODE  A  1 lymph node  bisected B I  representative sections of the other lymph nodes J Q  entire biopsy cavity R  old biopsy cavity from medial incision S CC  representative section of breast parenchyma DD  section through nipple  Resident  Sigrid Regauer  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  James M Fitzgerald  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Present.
