ections of biopsy cavity and adjacent margin  mid posterior margin   C D  Representative sections of fibrous tissue surrounding biopsy cavity and closest  anterior inferior  margin  0 8cm grossly  E G  Further representative sections of biopsy cavity  H J  Representative sections of ill defined nodular fibrous areas within the breast parenchyma  the closest of which approaches the posterior margin  closest margin  0 6cm  K L   highest  lymph nodes  largest bivalved and half submitted  smallest are entirely submitted  M N  Mid portion lymph nodes entirely submitted  O  Lowest lymph nodes entirely submitted  Resident  AARON CAPLAN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Present.
