DA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 15 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast modified radical mastectomy   is a 23 x 18 x 4 0cm breast with REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm attached axilla  The overlying 23 x 7 3cm skin is pink tan with a REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm light brown areola and a 1 3cm in diameter nipple  A 2 5cm curvilinear well healed scar is 1 0cm lateral and inferior to the nipple  Two similarly sized brown macular papules measuring 0 2cm in diameter are located 0 5cm and 1 0cm superior and lateral to the nipple  Multiple light brown macules measuring REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm located in the medial and superior quadrant of the breast  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm ill defined pink tan rubbery subareolar region  This region comes within 4 0cm to the deepest resection margin and 2 5cm from the anterior inferior resection margin  Three ill defined pink tan slightly rubbery soft tissue are present around this subareolar region  The first soft tissue region measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  is within 1 0cm superior from the larger subareolar region  and approximately 3 0cm from the closest deep resection margin  The second soft tissue region measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  is within 0 5cm inferior of the subareolar region  and is within 1 5cm from the inferior anterior deep resection margin  The third ill defined pink tan slightly rubbery area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm is present 2 0cm superior medial to the subareolar mass  and is approximately 2 5cm from the closest deep resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is 90   of tan yellow mature adipose tissue and approximately 10  pink tan