Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  09 REMOVED_MONTH 96 ACCESSIONED ON  09 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 10 24 CLINICAL DATA   None Provided                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   CORE BIOPSY  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 21                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS BREAST  LEFT   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  Rare tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 17 15 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is an aggregate of tan yellow and red cores of tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  submitted entirely in cassette A  Gross Description by  Mark Tutschka Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Robert Gerdes Ojemann  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  Peggy Lynn Ueda  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST  CORE BIOPSY , Absent.
