e  opaque discoloration  forming a 1cm rim along the biopsy cavity  The biopsy appears to extend to the inferior excised margin  This margin is in A  Sections from the biopsy cavity are in B through G  Parenchyma away from biopsy cavity is in H  Designated  additional lateral tissue  long equals new lateral margin  short equals superior  is a 4 x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm fragment of breast tissue with a long and short stitch  The new lateral excised surface is inked black  and the medial inked red  Cross sectioning reveals firm  white tissue with cystic changes admixed with adipose tissue  Fully submitted in I through M  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael V Seiden  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT  ADDITIONAL LATERAL    EXCISIONAL BIO PART B  BREAST  LEFT TUMOR   EXCISION   report_end  , Absent.
