opsy site  2  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is yellow tan  fibrofatty tissue with occasional areas of fibrosis measuring REMOVED_DATE to 1 0cm  SECTION CODE  A  Representative section  biopsy site  1  closest deep resection margin  B E  Representative sections of biopsy site  1  D and E including skin  F  Closest deep resection margin  biopsy site  2  G J  Representative sections of biopsy site  2  KandL  Representative sections of firm breast nodules adjacent to biopsy site  2  M  Representative section of normal breast  N R  Representative sections of axillary nodes  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  PART   BREAST and AXILLARY NODES  RIGHT    report_end  , Present.
