mes within less than 0 1cm of an inked resection margin  The remaining parenchyma is unremarkable  Section code  A D representative sections of firm nodule E I representative sections of breast parenchyma  including   prior breast cavity J  representative section of grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma and representative section of skin ellipse Labeled  axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm mass of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with a suture designating the superior aspect  Several lymph nodes measuring from REMOVED_DATE to 3 0cm in greatest dimension are dissected from the soft tissue and submitted in K M  inferior to superior  Resident  Douglas B  Flieder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  Mark Lawrence Blucher  M D  PART A  AXILLA  RIGHT  PART B  BREAST  RIGHT    report_end  , Present.
