gin   E   Tumor  F   Separate medial nodules  G   Unremarkable breast  Received fresh in a container   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and further labeled  Right Axillary Node   is an axillary node dissection measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm  The specimen is serially sectioned  but reveals no definite lymph nodes  Representative sections are submitted H K  Resident  JEROME T  O CONNELL JR   MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Randall David Gaz  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B    LYMPH NODES   RIGHT AXILLARY   EXCISION , Absent.
