Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  21 AUG 98 ACCESSIONED ON  21 AUG 98 at 14 04 CLINICAL DATA  Right breast 5 o clock core biopsy    cancer                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   CORE BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  HIGH GRADE  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  25 AUG 98 at 16 14                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right   The tumor cells do not stain for estrogen receptor protein  Rare tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 31 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and no designation as to site  is an aggregate of soft  tan pink fragments of tan pink tissue measuring in an aggregate of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  The specimen is submitted entirely in Cassette A  Gross Description by  Jason Corbin Resident  ADRIANO PIRIS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Doreen Akosua Mensah  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   CORE BIOPSY , Absent.
