gin to cyst  grossly uninvolved F H  fibrotic areas in remainder of breast parenchyma Labeled  left breast  additional inferior tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm adipose tissue fragment with an unremarkable cut surface  entirely submitted in I J  Resident  DARRYL E  PALMER TOY  MD PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT    INFERIOR TISSUE  , Present.
