ue consistent with fat necrosis and contains soft red brown tissue  The wall of the cavity averages 0 2cm  and there is surrounding dense white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  The remaining cut surfaces show unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  Sectioning of the lateral breast tissue reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm hemorrhagic firm area with yellow orange discoloration consistent with fat necrosis  No apparent lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity to deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved fibrous tissue away from cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative hemorrhagic area with fat necrosis in upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections of skin and anterior margin  Gross Dictation by Stephanie Kuehn  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Paula Arnell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Paula Arnell M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Absent.
