ibrous tissue measuring 1 2cm in greatest dimension and abutting the anterior and superior resection margins  The specimen is submitted entirely  from medial to lateral  in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the previously described slightly firmer area in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION  report_end  , Absent.
