ges  Section code  A  Biopsy cavity with deep margin  B  Biopsy cavity with anterior margin  C G  Sections of biopsy site  H  Gritty area lateral to biopsy site  I K  Fibrocystic areas  The axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  which are submitted in L T  with L containing sections of a single node  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm aggregate of irregular breast tissues  some with overlying skin  Cross sectioning reveals mixed fibrous and fatty tissue  with scattered microcysts  Representative sections are in U through DD  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Rosen  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT AXILLARY   CONTENTS PART B  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Present.
