or margin and comes to 2cm of the anterior margin  Beneath the second scar is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6 cm ill defined  firm area containing focal chalky yellow adipose tissue and one clip  There is also a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7 cm well circumscribed  firm  tan to white nodule located 0 5cm superior to the cavity  which comes to 2 3cm of the posterior margin  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  well circumscribed  tan pink nodule in the upper outer quadrant  Representative sections are submitted as follows  Section Code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity to nearest posterior margin  to include defect   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Firm  well circumscribed nodule  superior to cavity  to include nearest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Firm area subjacent to the second most lateral scar   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nodular fibrous tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant nodule  bisected  possible lymph node   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant tissue which may represent lymph nodes  Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY  report_end  , Absent.
