Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  09 REMOVED_MONTH 98 ACCESSIONED ON  09 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 09 24 CLINICAL DATA   None Provided                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   CORE BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The carcinoma is not a colloid carcinoma  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 15 28                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Left   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  18 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 07 34 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and no designation as to site  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm aggregate of soft tan cores of tissue  submitted in toto in Cassette A  Gross Description by  Joe Serra Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Barbara Joyce Nath  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   CORE BIOPSY   report_end  , Absent.
